00:06:26.382 --> 00:06:28.503
I asked mom. I told her "I'm a man.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.847
A man meant to survive
and live off the land."

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:35.953
It was all good.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:44.170
Well, that year Christmas,
I got in with a girlfriend,

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.233
