00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:06.090
I know what plants to make medicine.

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:07.650
It was the, the time of my life

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.093
cause I learned so much
from that, from that woman.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.433
When I got older at 21,
I married that woman.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.823
No, I had a baby, Maria.

